WEBVTT

00:08:30.663 --> 00:08:32.246
But there's something you need to know.

00:08:32.579 --> 00:08:35.996
All that thinking about making a
change that is not ruminating,

00:08:36.162 --> 00:08:41.662
that is doing some hard mental work
doesn't necessarily feel good,

00:08:41.954 --> 00:08:45.787
but it is a good thing.
What I mean. Exactly.

00:08:45.954 --> 00:08:48.829
And your first assignment
after the break.

00:08:52.787 --> 00:08:53.787
At.